--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a0711db1b03ce448c93419c25aa574d8, type: 3}
  m_Name: IntroCutscene
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogLines:
  - speakerName: Kael
    dialogText: "Hey Noah. The Resonance Towers are performing better than expected\u2026
      at least on the surface the air seems cleaner. But\u2014 I still have doubts."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ee7d0d39903274e89af637a31c9dbc04, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Kael
    dialogText: "And yet, in some areas, something is changing too fast. Something
      is\u2026 growing."
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Kael
    dialogText: This is the first specimen we managed to capture. They found it in
      the eastern sector of Prinswist, after a series of strange incidents.
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Kael
    dialogText: "We still don\u2019t know if it\u2019s a chemical reaction, biological\u2026
      or something completely different. And it gets worse every day."
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Kael
    dialogText: "It only moves when it hears certain sounds. It doesn\u2019t react
      to everything, it chooses. It\u2019s as if\u2026 it were reading the environment
      through hearing."
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Kael
    dialogText: "That\u2019s why you\u2019re here, Noah. I want to understand if
      there\u2019s a pattern. Welcome to the Factory."
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Kael
    dialogText: "I\u2019ll let you use our latest prototype: an echolocator. If it
      works the way I think\u2026 we\u2019ll see what it \u201Chears\u201D."
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Kael
    dialogText: "Observe, study. And try not to make too much noise. I\u2019ll go
      back to analyzing the data\u2026 something doesn\u2019t add up."
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
